ions over the long run  if we go that route it's a marketplace  out there  and conservatives and people who feel  that the existing structure are not  right they have the opportunity  to start different structures and of  course that's happening  many many of you may be interested may  be familiar with parlor which is a  straight out competitor to twitter and  facebook  and so many conservatives like dan  bongino  are striking deals and taking their  conversation there  it is a tough challenge for markets to  beat the economies of scale that are out  of course they're pursuing the same  economies of scale we'll see if they  have  100 billion dollar valuations in their  future  we should note that section 230 makes it  easier for the entrance  not harder that is to say if you impose  liability  on the internet platforms now you're  going to be sticking it to the entrance  and that's per  the ceo of parlor just the other day  okay yeah it's a tough challenge  uh for government to get things right  but uh it might be an easier challenge  for the market to get things right  and it's certainly a worthy project to  try  and i'll just point you in the direction  of hillsdale college  strength rejoices in challenge  thank you very much and as i say please  address  comments complaints groupons and bitcoin  to hazletaclemson.edu  have a great day thank you very much  you
 

